{"id":"en_the-villainess-s-fifth-life","title":"The Villainess’s | Fifth Life","titleEn":"The Villainess’s | Fifth Life","description":"After being brutally executed four times by her stepsister and former fiancé, a ducal heiress is reborn for a fifth time. She chooses to embrace the villainess role, and together with a masked ally, she sets out to take revenge on those who tormented her. For those interested in following this story, Dramzio is a place where the series and its episodes can be watched.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/85686b38ce34792f/hi_IN/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/85686b38ce34792f/hi_IN/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["पुनर्जन्म","बदला","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dld2k/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-villainess-s-fifth-life_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dld2k/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-villainess-s-fifth-life_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dld2k/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-villainess-s-fifth-life_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dld2k/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-villainess-s-fifth-life_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dld2k/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-villainess-s-fifth-life_5","title":"Episode 5","season":1,"number":5,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble